[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6000.95, "timestamp": "01:40:00", "text": "因為他們知道我是一個初來乍到的人。當然，犯錯也是不可避免的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6013.43, "timestamp": "01:40:13", "text": "但你也會從中學到教訓。是的。嗯。沒錯。呃，你在那裡待了幾年？我待了一年。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6028.39, "timestamp": "01:40:28", "text": "啊。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6031.35, "timestamp": "01:40:31", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6034.51, "timestamp": "01:40:34", "text": "我知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6039.55, "timestamp": "01:40:39", "text": "就像我們之前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6042.149, "timestamp": "01:40:42", "text": "說的，我們之前也在私訊裡聊過。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6056.79, "timestamp": "01:40:56", "text": "或許有些人不知道，我一直以為"}]